flowchart TB
    S["Request: publish a port<br/>outside the Gateway"]
    Q1{"Is it HTTP, gRPC<br/>or WebSocket?"}
    Q2{"Is there an implicit option?<br/>HTTPS with a token, Kafka Bridge,<br/>MQTT over WebSocket, mTLS at the GLB"}
    Q3{"Administrative access,<br/>database, debugging<br/>or temporary?"}
    Q4{"Complete business justification<br/>and a future review_by?"}
    Q5{"Does the counterparty<br/>come over the internet?"}
    GW["Through the Gateway<br/>HTTPRoute"]
    ALT["Use the implicit option"]
    NO["Rejected<br/>kubectl exec · IAP · ephemeral ·<br/>private connectivity"]
    B["Pattern B<br/>fixed NodePort + passthrough NLB<br/>in gcp-qa-edge · direct communication"]
    C["Pattern D<br/>internal passthrough NLB<br/>over peering or VPN"]
    CTL["exposures in the manifest<br/>G1 · CODEOWNERS platform and security<br/>Gatekeeper exemption per Service"]

    S --> Q1
    Q1 -->|yes| GW
    Q1 -->|no| Q2
    Q2 -->|yes| ALT
    Q2 -->|no| Q3
    Q3 -->|yes| NO
    Q3 -->|no| Q4
    Q4 -->|no| NO
    Q4 -->|yes| Q5
    Q5 -->|yes| B
    Q5 -->|no, private network| C
    B --> CTL
    C --> CTL

    style NO fill:#fce8e6
    style GW fill:#e6f4ea
    style ALT fill:#e6f4ea
    style CTL fill:#e8f0fe
